  "description": "<p>Currently none of the LDP-RSs return following header. </p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\nLink: &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/ns/ldp#RDFSource&gt;; rel=<span class=\"code-quote\">\"type\"</span></span></pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>To complete this ticket, ensure that the link header returned for all</p>\n\n<p>LDP-RS's including LDPRv (versioned resources), LDPCv (timemaps),  and ACLs.</p>\n\n<p>CTS Test <a href=\"https://fedora.info/2018/06/25/spec/#solid-ldp-acls\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">5.1</a> should pass once this issue is resolved.</p>",
